[{"id": "2426191", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-11-11", "store": "ExcellentSupply.com", "meta": ["United States", "2 days using the app"], "text": "Loving what Altera can do. Here are a few things that I'm liking so far: (1) Enables me to avoid manual product-page editing by letting me bulk-update prices, tags, SEO fields, and descriptions in one pass instead of one product at a time (2) Keeps my SEO rankings intact when I rename product URLs \u2014 automatic redirects mean no lost traffic or broken links (3) Gives me a safe way to add new product sizes/variants in bulk without touching existing inventory or pricing (4) Can easily add or remove tags from customers (5) Built-in safeguards (identifier matching, blank-cell protections, test-before-commit) prevent accidental overwrites on a live store"}, {"id": "2390253", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-10-09", "store": "WymWolf", "meta": ["Canada", "5 months using the app"], "text": "J'appr\u00e9cie vraiment cette app, tr\u00e8s utile et rapide. C'est un must \u00e0 mon avis lorsque l'on construit nos produits"}, {"id": "2359688", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-09-14", "store": "UPVC Spares4Repairs", "meta": ["United Kingdom", "3 months using the app"], "text": "The support for Altera is excellent. I have contacted support via the live chat feature a couple of times and have received a prompt response / resolution within minutes each time."}, {"id": "2351620", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-09-07", "store": "TrophyCentral", "meta": ["United States", "10 days using the app"], "text": "Excellent app - very pleased with functionality and support. It is simple, yet very powerful and well-designed. Neil trophycentral.com"}, {"id": "2271534", "rating": 4, "date": "2026-07-04", "store": "Emerald Ripple", "meta": ["Ireland", "8 days using the app"], "text": "The app does what it promises, but it's disappointing that merchants have to pay an extra $15 for functionality that Shopify itself should provide out of the box. Exporting store data is a basic administrative feature and shouldn't require a paid third-party app."}, {"id": "2266224", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-06-30", "store": "PortionIQ", "meta": ["United Kingdom", "About 1 hour using the app"], "text": "Allows download and upload of data via command line and therefore automation. Great app! (it would be nice to see the filename of the Job, and a copy job function to ease transfer from Dev to Live, but that is just me being picky)"}, {"id": "2311015", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-08-05", "store": "UrbexNow", "meta": ["Netherlands", "About 23 hours using the app"], "text": "Wat een fantastische app. Het werkt gewoon zoals het moet werken en het is snel. Het is even kijken hoe alles werkt. Maar als je het weet hoe het werkt is het echt super! Dit is 100% aan te raden, ook vanwege de prijs, gewoon een normale nette prijs voor de service. Persoonlijk geen contact gehad met de klantenservice, dus daar kan ik niet over oordelen."}, {"id": "2416350", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-11-02", "store": "CBRN Masks", "meta": ["Israel", "5 months using the app"], "text": "Must-have app for every business"}, {"id": "2411944", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-10-29", "store": "Kaffa bedriftsportal", "meta": ["Norway", "3 months using the app"], "text": "My #1 tool in shopify. Automate with google workspace, use it with Claude. Gives you superpowers Lifesaver"}, {"id": "2285143", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-07-15", "store": "ITMAR", "meta": ["Romania", "10 days using the app"], "text": "good app and great support! staff is very helpful"}, {"id": "2350272", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-09-06", "store": "Bug & Goose Play Cafe", "meta": ["United States", "About 22 hours using the app"], "text": "helpful customer service"}, {"id": "2344628", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-09-01", "store": "Kost\u00fcmpalast", "meta": ["Germany", "15 days using the app"], "text": "Literally the best app on this plattform. Yes, other apps boost conversions and do other e-commerce buzzword things but this... this is the holy grail of Shopify"}, {"id": "2342458", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-08-31", "store": "ALBERT KREUZ", "meta": ["Germany", "4 days using the app"], "text": "Perfektes Hilfsmittel f\u00fcr die Pflege des Onlineshops."}, {"id": "2283470", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-07-14", "store": "Odette Store", "meta": ["Belgium", "2 days using the app"], "text": "Fantastic tool backed by an even better support team. I've been using Altera for a catalog restructuring project (splitting and relinking product options to metaobjects across hundreds of products). The app itself handles bulk operations that would otherwise take forever manually. What really stood out was the support. I ran into a limitation (converting a linked option from one metaobject type to another wasn't supported yet), reached out, and Daniel personally looked into it and shipped the feature the very same day. That kind of responsiveness is rare, and it made a real difference for my project. Highly recommend if you're doing any data management on Shopify."}, {"id": "2332737", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-08-23", "store": "Live Your Home store", "meta": ["Greece", "4 days using the app"], "text": "Excellent app!"}, {"id": "2327070", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-08-18", "store": "Home Educational Resources ", "meta": ["United States", "17 days using the app"], "text": "Works great!"}, {"id": "2206426", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-05-16", "store": "Truly Art", "meta": ["United States", "About 12 hours using the app"], "text": "I am user of Matrixify last 5 years, this one is better - it allows me to publish Videos to 1k+ products without creating duplicates. **Huge breakthrough**. Whoever coded this understood the subtleties of what Matrixify (not really updated functionality in a while) was capable of, and improved. The heavy hitters in legacy apps can get complacent...this might be my new favorite app. It's no small task to outperform Matrixify."}, {"id": "2295835", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-07-23", "store": "RON'S Collection & Fragrances.", "meta": ["United States", "13 days using the app"], "text": "Great!"}, {"id": "2284484", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-07-14", "store": "SIP Jewelry", "meta": ["Indonesia", "About 21 hours using the app"], "text": "Effective!"}, {"id": "2278684", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-07-09", "store": "Mobile Life", "meta": ["Singapore", "31 minutes using the app"], "text": "really easy to use"}, {"id": "2156975", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-04-10", "store": "Monta\u00f1a M\u00e1gica", "meta": ["United Kingdom", "30 days using the app"], "text": "what can i say? well, it's the backup compiler and reinstaller of choice for all of our websites. although we haven't needed to use the backups in anger, yet, having analysed and reviewed the data extracts, this should not cause an issue when we do. having come from an IT background, i know thru experience that backups are crucial to the running and longevity of any and all websites. do a backup daily! the export itself, in the format of a simple spreadsheet, is very helpful too. a thousands thank yous, dudes and dudettes!"}, {"id": "2338776", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-08-27", "store": "Regalos Kokoro3", "meta": ["Mexico", "About 17 hours using the app"], "text": "Easy app"}, {"id": "2024131", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-01-04", "store": "Prixa Dise\u00f1os ", "meta": ["Colombia", "24 days using the app"], "text": "los pedidos subidos en masa no permiten ser editados"}, {"id": "1856551", "rating": 5, "date": "2025-08-28", "store": "Kroeshaar", "meta": ["Netherlands", "12 days using the app"], "text": "Absolutely great product. It exported my nearly 1000 blogs in a minute or two."}, {"id": "1840400", "rating": 5, "date": "2025-08-15", "store": "WhatNaturalsLove.com ", "meta": ["United States", "11 minutes using the app"], "text": "I am super impressed! In 3m 8s this app exported 1,174 pages and blog posts. Absolute great tool! Thank you guys. You saved me so much time."}, {"id": "1814953", "rating": 5, "date": "2025-07-27", "store": "Fine Food Specialist", "meta": ["United Kingdom", "About 2 months using the app"], "text": "Altera has been super helpful with migrating data and reviewing content in bulk. It offers great flexibility in identifying products, collections and custom bulk data. In several instances I've needed development outside the standard implementation and Altera support has been really helpful and aimed to deliver everything we've asked. Daniel has been particularly helpful and answered all questions with helpful and insightful solutions."}, {"id": "2245382", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-06-15", "store": "Mixologie Wholesale", "meta": ["United States", "10 days using the app"], "text": "Wow, wow, wow! If you need to combine order data with customer data - this is your solution! I just wish I'd found it sooner!"}, {"id": "2188078", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-05-03", "store": "\u0130stanbul Ofis Mobilya", "meta": ["T\u00fcrkiye", "2 days using the app"], "text": "Pratik ve H\u0131z kazand\u0131r\u0131yor"}, {"id": "2170608", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-04-20", "store": "Sonsuh Educational Supplies Inc.", "meta": ["Canada", "6 months using the app"], "text": "A must have and worth every penny. Helped us solve and Issues that Shopify themselves could not fix. The support team is fantastic. I love the CLI too."}, {"id": "2165229", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-04-16", "store": "LA SIESTA", "meta": ["United States", "4 minutes using the app"], "text": "Was exactly what I was looking for. I exported about 10 metaobject definitions which include fields connectiong to other metaobjects. Import worked fine and even the connections between definitions work."}, {"id": "2125380", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-03-18", "store": "Wolf Eyes", "meta": ["Australia", "About 1 hour using the app"], "text": "Great product, simple to use, so far so good. Using it for Shopify to Shopify and appears flawless on customers so far"}, {"id": "2214710", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-05-22", "store": "Fuelledbyteks", "meta": ["United Kingdom", "22 days using the app"], "text": "Great app, doing everything I want"}, {"id": "2107407", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-03-05", "store": "Pet n Pony", "meta": ["United Kingdom", "7 months using the app"], "text": "Amazing App an absolute must have for any shopify store owner. My interactions with the team at Altera have always been helpful and accomadating. even implementing new features on request within a few hours."}, {"id": "2047543", "rating": 5, "date": "2026-01-21", "store": "Lock n Load Publishing", "meta": ["United States", "29 days using the app"], "text": "This is an excellent app for Shopify users. I must take a moment and give a shout-out to their support person, Daniel. Daniel keeps answering my questions quickly, even making a video to help. Its the level of support and quality that makes this worth getting."}, {"id": "2004241", "rating": 5, "date": "2025-12-16", "store": "Nucleus Torr\u00e9facteurs", "meta": ["Canada", "2 months using the app"], "text": "Super helpful, thanks a lot for making this! You're saving us SO MUCH TIME. Small tip : export your stuff with Altera and use ChatGPT or other AI to manipulate your data, they're actually very great."}, {"id": "1985099", "rating": 5, "date": "2025-12-02", "store": "Foragers.Love", "meta": ["United Kingdom", "26 days using the app"], "text": "so far, so good. comprehensive download functionality. downloads are surprisingly quick. gracias Altera."}, {"id": "1925901", "rating": 5, "date": "2025-10-22", "store": "VELTUFF\u00ae UK", "meta": ["United Kingdom", "2 months using the app"], "text": "Excellent so far. Support really good and responsive to questions and requirements. Highly recommend."}, {"id": "1863041", "rating": 5, "date": "2025-09-02", "store": "Rug Love", "meta": ["United Kingdom", "6 days using the app"], "text": "perfect for exporting collections. Amazing App"}, {"id": "1851827", "rating": 5, "date": "2025-08-25", "store": "\u05e9\u0